@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/>.

coll:List a owl:Class.
dcterms:description a owl:AnnotationProperty.
dcterms:issued a owl:AnnotationProperty.
dcterms:modified a owl:AnnotationProperty.
dcterms:title a owl:AnnotationProperty.
<http://purl.org/healthcarevocab/v1> dcterms:description """
Ontology for healthcare metadata - especially metadata found in DICOM files 
(Digital Imaging and Communications in Medicine, see http://dicom.nema.org/).

Author: Michael Brunnbauer, Bonubase GmbH (www.bonubase.com).
The author's email address is brunni@netestate.de.

See http://purl.org/healthcarevocab/v1help for explanations.
""";
                                     dcterms:issued "2013-04-29"^^xsd:date;
                                     dcterms:modified "2013-07-06"^^xsd:date;
                                     dcterms:title "Healthcare metadata / DICOM ontology";
                                     vann:preferredNamespacePrefix "dicom";
                                     vann:preferredNamespaceUri "http://purl.org/healthcarevocab/v1#";
                                     a owl:Ontology;
                                     rdfs:comment """
Ontology for healthcare metadata - especially metadata found in DICOM files 
(Digital Imaging and Communications in Medicine, see http://dicom.nema.org/).

Author: Michael Brunnbauer, Bonubase GmbH (www.bonubase.com).
The author's email address is brunni@netestate.de.

See http://purl.org/healthcarevocab/v1help for explanations.
""";
                                     rdfs:label "Healthcare metadata / DICOM ontology".
dicom:ALinePixelSpacing a owl:DatatypeProperty;
